credentials.json
token_*.json
accounts.json
# Signing keystores. Committing one is the single unrecoverable mistake in
# this repo: anyone holding it can sign an APK that Android installs as an
# update over every user's copy, inheriting their credentials and tokens.
# Keep the real keystore outside the repo entirely — this is only a backstop.
*.jks
*.keystore
.ourcal-venv/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
dist/
build/
packaging/android/build/
packaging/android/.build-venv/
packaging/android/src/ourcal/core.py
packaging/android/src/ourcal/resources/
